+
+```bash
+# The two test files are independent — write them concurrently:
+Task: "T006-T009 engine tests in tests/test_redact.py"   # one owner, sequential within the file
+Task: "T010 stdin CLI tests in tests/test_cli.py"        # different file, truly parallel
+```
+
+```bash
