+## Implementation Strategy
+
+### MVP First (User Story 1 Only)
+
+1. Phase 1: Setup (T001-T003)
+2. Phase 2: Foundational (T004-T005) — blocks everything
+3. Phase 3: User Story 1 (T006-T017)
+4. **STOP and VALIDATE**: run quickstart.md Scenario 1 and `pytest tests/test_redact.py`
+5. The tool is already useful for the most common case — ad-hoc piping
+
+### Incremental Delivery
+
+1. Setup + Foundational → foundation ready
+2. + US1 → pipe anything through it (**MVP**)
+3. + US2 → named files in argument order
+4. + US3 → the `--count` tally
+5. + US4 → loud failure on unreadable input
+6. + Polish → SC-002/SC-003 corpora, SC-001/SC-006 tests, merge gate
+
+Each increment leaves the suite green and adds no regression to earlier stories.
